  "description": "Welcome to an exclusive spa where relaxation comes with chemistry.\n\nIn Spa Massage Boys: Love & Relax, you’ll meet confident, charming guys ready to unwind with you. Enjoy satisfying massage-themed minigames while building attraction through playful conversations and bold choices.\n\nEach guy has his own vibe, from confident and teasing to calm and mysterious. Learn what makes them relax, discover their reactions, and unlock special moments as you progress.\n\nKeep your focus, read the mood, and let the connection grow.\n\n\nFEATURES:\n\n● Massage-based minigames focused on timing and precision.\n\n● Flirty, choice-driven conversations.\n\n● Unlockable images and exclusive scenes.\n\n● Different personalities and story routes.\n\n● Multiple endings depending on your performance and decisions.\n\n\nCan you handle the heat behind closed doors?\n\nStep into the spa, take a deep breath… and see where the tension leads.\n\nAre you ready?",
